import{_ as o,o as i,c as t,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 154 | Realm Refinement · World-Creation Realm · Planetary and Cosmic Beings Promotion Logic","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 154 | Realm Refinement · World-Creation Realm · Planetary and Cosmic Beings Promotion Logic","no":154,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","World-Creation Realm","Planetary Consciousness","Cosmic Beings","Promotion Logic"],"related":["14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification","53-Exotic Life Recognition Standard","20-Anchor Structure and Layers"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0154_模块1-创世境-星球级宇宙生灵晋升.md","filePath":"en/0154_模块1-创世境-星球级宇宙生灵晋升.md"}'),a={name:"en/0154_模块1-创世境-星球级宇宙生灵晋升.md"};function r(s,e,l,c,u,h){return i(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-154-world-creation-realm-promotion-logic-for-planetary-life-and-cosmic-beings" tabindex="-1">Entry 154 | World-Creation Realm: Promotion Logic for Planetary Life and Cosmic Beings <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-154-world-creation-realm-promotion-logic-for-planetary-life-and-cosmic-beings" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 154 | World-Creation Realm: Promotion Logic for Planetary Life and Cosmic Beings&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 14, 53, 20</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-when-a-planet-decides-to-give-birth-to-another" tabindex="-1">Introduction: When a planet decides to &quot;give birth to another&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-when-a-planet-decides-to-give-birth-to-another" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: When a planet decides to &quot;give birth to another&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s World-Creation Realm requires, per the Unified Cultivation Realm Classification (Document 14), &quot;creating a complete world in an isolated space.&quot; For individual cultivators, this is learning a creation technique; for <strong>planetary consciousness and cosmic beings</strong>, this equals requiring &quot;an entire cosmic region learn to gestate another cosmic region.&quot; In the Boundary-Breaking Realm (Entry 147) they learned to &quot;drop by&quot;; in the World-Creation Realm they must learn to &quot;give birth.&quot; This entry explains the promotion logic of such giant life in the World-Creation Realm.</p><p>The six top-level axioms running through the text are pushed to the scale of cosmic birth here: the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires newly born cosmic regions to equally be cultivation homes; the anti-predation axiom forbids giant life from reproducing by &quot;fission-swallowing&quot;; the collective ascension axiom requires new cosmic regions to give back to Myriad Races; causal self-discipline and law-first constrain such cosmic-level birth from tearing existing structures. Per the Exotic Life Recognition Standard (Document 53) and Anchor Structure and Layers (Document 20), unfolding giant life&#39;s creation path. Among them, Article 6 the universal equal infinite law establishes the origin logic that all beings inherently possess basic infinite power, and predation loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-promotion-logic-from-being-a-world-yourself-to-gestating-another-world" tabindex="-1">I. Promotion Logic: From &quot;being a world yourself&quot; to &quot;gestating another world&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-promotion-logic-from-being-a-world-yourself-to-gestating-another-world" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Promotion Logic: From &quot;being a world yourself&quot; to &quot;gestating another world&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Planetary-level beings&#39; world creation differs from individual cultivators in three fundamental dimensions:</p><ol><li><strong>Creation material is &quot;a part of oneself&quot;</strong>: individuals create in an external isolated space; planetary consciousness gestating a new cosmic region is &quot;branching off a vein&quot; from its own law domain, not starting from scratch</li><li><strong>Time scale counted in hundreds of millions of years</strong>: individual world creation takes decades; planetary consciousness gestating a self-consistent cosmic region takes geological-scale time</li><li><strong>Gestating is guarding</strong>: the new cosmic region couples with the mother from birth; the mother must nourish it throughout, otherwise the newborn dies</li></ol><p>Its standard chain:</p><ul><li><strong>Self-completion</strong>: the mother planet/cosmic region first completes boundary-breaking, its own laws self-consistent, ecology stable</li><li><strong>Law branching</strong>: from the mother&#39;s laws, branch a set of self-consistent &quot;offspring laws,&quot; both inheriting mother features and having independent evolution space</li><li><strong>Cosmic region gestation</strong>: in an isolated space beside the mother, let the offspring cosmic region gradually take shape</li><li><strong>Weaning and independence</strong>: after offspring laws stably run autonomously, moderately decouple from the mother, becoming an independent cultivation home</li></ul><h2 id="ii-unique-pain-points-and-costs" tabindex="-1">II. Unique Pain Points and Costs <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-unique-pain-points-and-costs" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Unique Pain Points and Costs&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Giant life&#39;s world creation costs are cosmic-scale:</p><ul><li><strong>Mother depletion</strong>: gestation consumes the mother&#39;s large origin; requires Alaya Network allocation of incremental resources to nourish, avoiding premature mother aging</li><li><strong>Offspring deformity</strong>: if law branches conflict, the newborn cosmic region may have self-inconsistent laws and die young</li><li><strong>Beings implicated</strong>: during mother gestation, the cultivation fields of beings upon it are affected; must first do being-protection contingency plans</li><li><strong>Mother-child dependence</strong>: if over-coupled, the offspring cannot become independent, violating &quot;self-generated self-grown&quot;</li></ul><p>The Alaya Network and multi-layer supervision impose <strong>Anchor Council-level approval</strong> on such cosmic-level gestation, confirming the mother has enough surplus, offspring laws are self-consistent, and beings are unharmed, before allowing launch.</p><h2 id="iii-nested-coordination-with-individual-creators" tabindex="-1">III. Nested Coordination with Individual Creators <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-nested-coordination-with-individual-creators" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Nested Coordination with Individual Creators&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Planetary-level beings&#39; world creation is never isolated:</p><ul><li>Individual creators (Entries 150, 151) provide technical reference for law branching to giant mothers</li><li>The new cosmic region gestated by the mother in turn becomes a new home and resource increment for individual cultivators</li><li>Giant and individual nested creation constitutes Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s &quot;cosmoses endlessly generating&quot; expansion model — pure increment, zero predation</li></ul><p>This is precisely the anti-predation axiom&#39;s cosmic-scale redemption: the cosmos grows not by swallowing existing planes, but by all things freely gestating new increments.</p><h2 id="iv-breakthrough-features-from-cross-boundary-cosmic-being-to-gestation-type-cosmic-mother" tabindex="-1">IV. Breakthrough Features: From &quot;Cross-Boundary Cosmic Being&quot; to &quot;Gestation-Type Cosmic Mother&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-breakthrough-features-from-cross-boundary-cosmic-being-to-gestation-type-cosmic-mother" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Breakthrough Features: From &quot;Cross-Boundary Cosmic Being&quot; to &quot;Gestation-Type Cosmic Mother&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Markers for planetary-level beings who successfully create worlds:</p><ul><li>The offspring cosmic region branched from its own laws independently takes shape</li><li>Offspring laws self-consistent, autonomously runnable, containing a complete life cycle</li><li>The mother not exhausted by gestation, beings undisturbed</li><li>The offspring cosmic region is included in the Myriad Races republican system, becoming a new cultivation home</li></ul><p>Giant life reaching this step already has the foundation to push the Origin Realm (cosmic-level, Plane Transcendent threshold, see Entry 157) — it not only is a world itself, but can gestate new worlds.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: converting giant life&#39;s eons-accumulated evolutionary potential into cosmic increments, rather than letting the mother stiffen</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: cosmic expansion relies on pure-increment &quot;branch gestation,&quot; absolutely not on swallowing neighboring planes</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison</strong>: old-system cosmic behemoths grew by swallowing, devouring each other; Heng Yuan Zhou planetary consciousness grows by gestation, the cosmos births itself bigger</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: beings within newly born cosmic regions equally possess equal evolutionary qualification; &quot;paths for all stars&quot; extends to &quot;paths for all generations&quot;</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: giant gestation experience is relayed back network-wide, providing cosmic-scale samples for Multiverse Realm cross-cosmos governance</li></ul><p>It must be especially emphasized that giant life&#39;s &quot;branch gestation&quot; and individual creators&#39; &quot;isolated-space creation&quot; have an essential difference: individuals create worlds externally, the world is relatively independent of oneself; planetary consciousness branches a vein from its own laws, offspring and mother have a natural blood connection. This connection brings nourishment and also fetters — if the mother cannot bear to wean, the offspring can never run independently, ultimately becoming the mother&#39;s organ rather than a new home. The Anchor Council therefore specifically examines weaning plans during approval: has the mother designed a gradual decoupling timeline for the offspring, rather than a one-time permanent binding. Only a cosmic mother that learns to let go is qualified to speak of gestation.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>When a conscious planet learns to &quot;give birth to another,&quot; the cosmos is no longer stock to be divided, but living life that grows. Planetary-level beings&#39; world creation proves: true strength is not swallowing more, but gestating more. The cosmos&#39;s expansion ultimately relies on all things&#39; willingness to mutually fulfill.</p><p>In the final analysis, the World-Creation Realm planetary and cosmic being promotion described in this document is no isolated case — always pointing toward the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s co-building direction; law self-consistency is backstopped by the law-first axiom, not drifting with narrative convenience.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification</a> · <a href="./53-奇特生命识别标准.html">53-Exotic Life Recognition Standard</a> · <a href="./20-锚点结构与层级.html">20-Anchor Structure and Layers</a> · <a href="./07-自生自长进化法则.html">07-Self-Generated Self-Grown Evolution Law</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',30)])])}const m=o(a,[["render",r]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
